id: VS-03-risk-analysis
name: "VS-03 \u2014 Risk Analysis"
short_description: Produce evidence-based understanding of exposure and drivers to
  support prioritisation and treatment design.
owner:
- Risk Owners
- Risk Function
- Finance
stakeholders:
- Risk Owners
- Risk Function
- Finance
- Security/Ops SMEs
- ExCo/Board (for material risks)
inputs:
- Risk records (VS-02)
- appetite/criteria (VS-00)
- control data (VS-06)
- KRI data (VS-07)
- loss/incidents (VS-09).
outputs:
- Inherent/residual ratings
- scenario analysis artefacts
- quantified exposure bands
- assumptions and evidence logs.
triggers:
- Material risks
- critical service reviews
- board deep dives
- initiative gates
- appetite breaches.
bounded_contexts: []
dependencies: []
last_updated: '2026-02-02'
source_file: docs/value-architecture/value-streams/VS-03-risk-analysis.md
